OL,3,GNEWSAGatwick strike called off after
OL,4,Apay deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrikes by more than 220 workers at
OL,7,FGatwick Airport have been called off
OL,8,Fafter they received an improved pay
OL,9,Foffer from their employer.
OL,11,FEmployees of Wilson James, which
OL,12,Fprovides assistance to passengers with
OL,13,Frestricted mobility, had been due to
OL,14,Fwalk out for eight days in September.
OL,16,FIndustrial action was suspended
OL,17,Ffollowing negotiations between the
OL,18,Fcompany and the Unite union, resulting
OL,19,Fin a new offer being overwhelmingly
OL,20,Faccepted.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
