OL,3,GNEWSAGatwick strike called off after
OL,4,Apay deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnite's general secretary, Sharon
OL,7,FGraham, called the deal, which includes
OL,8,Fa 5% pay rise backdated to April, "a
OL,9,Fgreat win for our members". Wilson
OL,10,FJames has been contacted for comment.
